  "overview": "Estonia Country Design Guidelines — Nordic national digital identity, Aino headline typography and cobalt blue surfaces",
  "dos": "- **Surface & Theme Polarity**: Crisp light (#f1f5f9) canvas paired with `#fff` component surfaces and `#0b0b0c` primary ink.\n- **Brand & Interactive Accent**: Primary actions and focus states anchor on `#002d72` with `#ffffff` label contrast.\n- **Typographic Voice**: Headings and UI controls set in `ainoBodyFont` across 15 type steps.\n- **Component Geometry**: Buttons (`8px`), cards (`12px`), inputs, badges, and navigation bars share consistent spacing and border contrast."
